{"3735400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chasing the Universe", "steam_appid": 3735400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>🧙🏻‍♀️ Speed and freedom await ! Get ready to invert ups &amp; downs as you wish !🧙🏻‍♀️</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing the Universe is a fast-paced FPS runner where you slide in space and teleport to gather the stars. Chase behind the universe within a saturated world to clear gravity-defying levels as fast as you can ! ✨</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>🌌 Speed and freedom 🌌</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your gravity to define your path to stay fast ! Teleport and align yourself to any wall, nothing is out limit !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>👍 Easy to play 👍</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press shift to slide, space to jump and left click to teleport ! No need to worry, immerse yourself directly in the speed and freedom !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>🪄 Establish records 🪄</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the level at high speed, the less time the better your rank ! Aim for the golden S, and maybe even further ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>🧙🏻‍♀️ Speed and freedom await ! Get ready to invert ups &amp; downs as you wish !🧙🏻‍♀️</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing the Universe is a fast-paced FPS runner where you slide in space and teleport to gather the stars. Chase behind the universe within a saturated world to clear gravity-defying levels as fast as you can ! ✨</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>🌌 Speed and freedom 🌌</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your gravity to define your path to stay fast ! Teleport and align yourself to any wall, nothing is out limit !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>👍 Easy to play 👍</stron